---
source: src/ui_tests.rs
expression: snapshot(&mut a)
---
 ck  Settings

    Keys                                              enter rebind · a add · x reset · esc close

    Everywhere
      q               quit             quit                                 everywhere
      ?               help             help                                 everywhere
      ,               settings         settings: theme, colors, keys, …     everywhere
      /               search           filter the list; search a thread     everywhere
      r               reload           reload                               everywhere
      o               browser          open in the browser                  everywhere
      :               goto             go to a URL or site/board/thread     everywhere
      ]               next_tab         next tab                             everywhere
      [               prev_tab         previous tab                         everywhere
      .               menu             what you can do with what's selected everywhere, image v…
      ctrl-w          close_tab        close the tab                        everywhere

    Lists
      f               hints            label what's on screen; type a labe… lists, catalog, thr…
      *               favorite         favorite board: on / off             lists, catalog

    Catalog
      v               view             view the post's images               catalog, thread
      w               watch            watch / unwatch the thread           catalog, thread
      s               sort             cycle the sort order                 catalog

    Changed keys are saved in [keys]; navigation keys are fixed.


 enter change   esc back   , settings   ? help
